            "description": "<p>Here are some of the stories Wall Street is watching on Thursday, Jan 22.</p>\n<p>All three of the major indexes are rising as President Trump cools his rhetoric on Greenland.</p>\n<p>Mortgage rates <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/mortgage-rates-edged-up-slightly-this-week-amid-market-swings-173952952.html\">ticked higher,</a> with the average 30-year mortgage rate at 6.09% through Wednesday, according to Freddie Mac data, up from 6.06% a week earlier.</p>\n<p>Moderna (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MRNA\">MRNA</a>) shares continue to rise on promising results from a cancer vaccine study.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
